flowchart LR

    subgraph Authentication
        A[Start] --> B[Register]
        B --> C[Login]
    end

    subgraph Shopping
        C --> D[Home]
        D --> E[Search Product]
        E --> F[Product Details]
        F --> G[Add to Cart]
    end

    subgraph Checkout
        G --> H[Cart]
        H --> I[Checkout]
        I --> J[Payment]
        J --> K[Order Confirmation]
    end

    K --> L[Track Order]
    L --> M[End]

Key symbols:

--> = flow direction

{ } = decision

[ ] = process/page

([ ]) = start/end

|Yes| / |No| = decision branches


